Made a sale on Beat22 but didn’t get the payment yet? Don’t worry, in most cases, there’s a simple reason behind it. Let’s walk you through everything you need to know.

1.  ## **Payments are not Instant**
    

Seller payments are processed after a **settlement period**, not immediately after the sale. **Settlement Time:** It usually takes **15 days** for payments to reflect in your bank account after a sale. To know more, [click here.](https://blog.beat22.com/beat22-introduces-14-day-payment-system-strengthening-trust-and-transparency-for-sellers/)

2.  ## **Payouts are scheduled in batches**
    

We process payouts in batches through our payment partners. If your payout is in queue, it will be sent during the next payout cycle. *Note:* Weekends and bank holidays can delay processing.

3.  ## **Have you added/updated your bank details ?**
    

Make sure your payout method is correctly set up.

-   Go to your **Profile Settings** → **Payout Bank Details**
-   Add your **Bank Details**
-   Ensure the details are accurate to avoid failed payouts

![Ensure the details are accurate to avoid failed payouts](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-233724.png)

4.  ## **Your payment has likely been initiated**
    

If it’s been over 5 business days and your payout hasn't reached you, it might already be **initiated but delayed** by the bank/payment gateway. You can:

-   **Check your email/SMS** for payment notifications
-   **Wait another 24–48 hours**
-   Or **contact our support team** at support@beat22.com

## **FAQs**

**Q: How often does Beat22 release payouts?** A: Every 15 days in regular cycles. **Q: Where can I see my earnings?** A: Go to your Browse → Studio Orders → Check "Payout Status." **Q: My payment failed. What should I do?** A: Double-check your payout details. If everything is correct, contact us with the screenshot of your sale. **Still need help?** Reach out to us anytime at **support@beat22.com** — we’re here to make sure you get paid smoothly.
